{c: Verse 1}
[A#]Aap iss tarah to,        [D#]Hosh uda [F]ya na kiji [A#]ye
Yu [F]ban savar ke,        Saamne [A#]aaya na kijiye
[A#]Kali kali zulfo ke,        [D#]Phande na [F]dalo
[F]Hamein zinda rehne do,        [A#]Ae husn walon
